# Commons Layer

See `docs/agents/architecture.md` and `docs/agents/coding-standards.md`.

- Entities in `entities/`, DB access via managers in `data-managers/`
- Business logic in `services/` — don't query DB from controllers
- Respect `tenantId` scoping on all tenant data
- Use bunyan for logging, typed errors from `src/errors/`
